{"accountName": "微步在线研究响应中心", "author": "微步在线研究响应中心", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "微步在线研究响应中心 2026-11-24 18:12 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞概况", "type": "h"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/T4OSm0sXdEMHyucXASDukc9icJTYqicaVyR2CmzqjFEQ9u4S20J2OUrCmuKyCaibrQHBEPrdZh5ibDjyfR6jbNWB7oVKDun6Hpzh7xuZHT7Lq28/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "11月24日，vCenter Server官方发布通告，修复了VMware vCenter Server 未授权管理员用户创建漏洞。 微步情报局已成功复现。 经分析，VMware vCenter Server 是 VMware 推出的虚拟化管理平台，其内置 vmdir 目录服务承载 SSO 身份目录。该服务在特定认证流程中存在访问控制缺陷，攻击者能访问 389 端口情况下，可能绕过身份验证，创建管理员账号并接管 vCenter。（完整漏洞情报请查阅 https://x.threatbook.com/v5/vul/XVE-2026-62902）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "此漏洞 无需任何权限 ，攻击者成功利用此漏洞可 创建管理员账号并接管 vCenter，跟 11月19日VMware官方发布CVE-2026-123890不是同一个漏洞， 建议受影响用户 尽快修复。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞处置优先级(VPT)", "type": "h"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "image.png", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T4OSm0sXdEPThhoIYMUwVySD1XEyM7Etn32HchNsZQUOpI9EjTmHxvTOhq3NApF21Ya8YNAEDQLRlVVlAVTQzF0RWYrgGUH0bwicicc9H9mFk/640?from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "风险等级：高风险 风险分数：9.8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "基本信息", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "XVE-2026-62902", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVE编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVE-2026-123903", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "身份鉴别错误", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件评估", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用漏洞的网络条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "可远程利用", "type": "p"}, {"text": "是否需要绕过安全机制", "type": "p"}, {"text": "不需要", "type": "p"}, {"text": "对被攻击系统的要求", "type": "p"}, {"text": "默认配置", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用漏洞的权限要求", "type": "p"}, {"text": "无需任何权限", "type": "p"}, {"text": "是否需要受害者配合", "type": "p"}, {"text": "不需要", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用情报", "type": "p"}, {"text": "POC是否公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已知利用行为", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞影响范围", "type": "h"}, {"text": "产品名称", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Vmware vCenter Server", "type": "p"}, {"text": "VMware Cloud Foundation Vmware Telco Cloud Platform Vmware Telco Cloud Infrastructure", "type": "p"}, {"text": "受影响版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "vCenter Server:", "type": "p"}, {"text": "9.1.x.x<=version<9.1.2 vCenter Server:", "type": "p"}, {"text": "9.0.x.x<=version<9.0.2.0300 vCenter Server:", "type": "p"}, {"text": "8.0<=version<8.0U3m", "type": "p"}, {"text": "vCenter Server: 7.x 未提供修复版本，联系官方咨询", "type": "p"}, {"text": "VMware Cloud Foundation: 5.x<=version<5.2.5", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Telco Cloud Platform: 3.0, 4.x, 5.0.x, 5.1.x, 5.2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Telco Cloud Infrastructure: 3.0", "type": "p"}, {"text": "有无修复补丁", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://support.broadcom.com/web/ecx/support-content-notification/-/external/content/SecurityAdvisories/0/39626", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞复现", "type": "h"}, {"text": "1. 首页", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2. 在8.0.3.01000版本执行poc，创建新用户", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3. 登录后台", "type": "p"}, {"text": "修复方案", "type": "h"}, {"text": "官方修复方案", "type": "h"}, {"text": "https://support.broadcom.com/web/ecx/support-content-notification/-/external/content/SecurityAdvisories/0/39626", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步产品支撑", "type": "h"}, {"text": "微步漏洞情报于 2026年9月14日 收录该漏洞。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步下一代威胁情报平台NGTIP，高级威胁情报平台ATI及X情报中心已于漏洞收录时向漏洞订阅用户推送该漏洞情报，并将持续推送后续更新；对于已经录入资产的用户，支持实时自动化排查受影响资产。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/T4OSm0sXdEMHyucXASDukc9icJTYqicaVyR2CmzqjFEQ9u4S20J2OUrCmuKyCaibrQHBEPrdZh5ibDjyfR6jbNWB7oVKDun6Hpzh7xuZHT7Lq28/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月24日", "id": "596520977", "summary": "微步在线研究响应中心 2026-11-24 18:12 北京 \n漏洞概况 \n11月24日，vCenter Server官方发布通告，修复了VMware vCenter Server 未授权管理员用户创建漏洞。 微步情报局已成功复现。 经分析，VMware vCenter Server 是 VMware 推出的虚拟化管理平台，其内置 vmdir 目录服务承载 SSO 身份目录。该服务在特定认证流程中", "title": "原创漏洞 | VMware vCenter Server 未授权管理员用户创建漏洞", "ts": 1795515120000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTc3ODY4Mw==&mid=2247509104&idx=1&sn=4640736488dc2811dcad0757e475a21c"}